<Border xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Tag="FullBleedBriefing" BorderBrush="#92968C" BorderThickness="1" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
  <Border.Resources>
    <Style TargetType="{x:Type TextBlock}">
      <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="/Assets/Resources/ui/fonts/#Special Elite"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#49677F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="18"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Normal"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="24"/>
      <Setter Property="LineStackingStrategy" Value="BlockLineHeight"/>
    </Style>
  </Border.Resources>
  <Border.Background>
    <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="1,0.8">
      <GradientStop Color="#DADCD5" Offset="0"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#F0F0E8" Offset="0.32"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#E7E9E2" Offset="0.76"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#D4D8D1" Offset="1"/>
    </LinearGradientBrush>
  </Border.Background>
  <Grid>
    <Canvas IsHitTestVisible="False" ClipToBounds="True">
      <Ellipse Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="39" Width="10" Height="13" Fill="#616456"/>
      <Path Stroke="#9A9F94" StrokeThickness="1" Data="M 18,39 L 14,28 15,14 11,2"/>
      <Ellipse Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="76" Width="10" Height="13" Fill="#616456"/>
      <Path Stroke="#D3D6CA" StrokeThickness="1.5" Data="M 13,83 C 14,89 20,90 24,85"/>
    </Canvas>
    <Border Width="2" Background="#9A9F94" Opacity="0.09" HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <Border Width="1" Background="#FFFFFF" Opacity="0.32" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="4,0,0,0" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <Border Height="1" Background="#9A9F94" Opacity="0.12" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <StackPanel Margin="38,30,28,30">
      <Border BorderBrush="#A24F4E" BorderThickness="1.5" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,5,22"
              HorizontalAlignment="Right" Opacity="0.8" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
        <Border.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="-2"/></Border.RenderTransform>
        <TextBlock Text="SECRET" Foreground="#A24F4E" FontSize="20" TextAlignment="Center"/>
      </Border>
      <TextBlock FontSize="20" LineHeight="26" Margin="0,0,0,20">MENSAJE "OPERACIONES"<LineBreak/>2 MAY 1982</TextBlock>
      <Grid Margin="0,0,0,20">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="54"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Text="FM" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Text="COMANDANTE DE OPERACIONES NAVALES" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Text="TO" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Text="COMANDANTE DE LA FLOTA DE MAR" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Text="SUBJ" Margin="0,0,8,6"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Text="STRIKE" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
      </Grid>
      <Border Height="1" Background="#7F939E" Opacity="0.45" Margin="0,0,0,20"/>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,16">1. SITUATION: THE BRITISH CARRIER FORCE IS CLOSING THE MALVINAS TO CONDUCT FURTHER AIR STRIKES AGAINST OUR POSITIONS. ITS PRECISE LOCATION HAS NOT BEEN CONFIRMED.</TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,16">2. MISSION: GRUPO DE TAREAS 79.1, CENTRED ON ARA 25 DE MAYO, IS TO STRIKE THE BRITISH CARRIER FORCE WITH THE OBJECTIVE OF SINKING AT LEAST ONE CARRIER.</TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,16">3. EXECUTION: UTILIZE S-2 TRACKERS AND 707 TO LOCATE THE ENEMY CARRIERS. CONFIRM THE CARRIER POSITION BEFORE LAUNCHING THE STRIKE. AIR FORCE MIRAGE FIGHTERS ARE AVAILABLE FOR COMBAT AIR PATROL.</TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,16">CONCENTRATE THE A-4QS IN ONE STRIKE AND COORDINATE THEIR APPROACH THROUGH THE ESCORT SCREEN. DIRECT THE ATTACK AGAINST THE CARRIERS. ON COMPLETION, RECOVER AIRCRAFT AND RETIRE WEST. DO NOT REMAIN TO PREPARE A SECOND STRIKE. ON RECEIPT OF THE WITHDRAWAL ORDER, COMPLETE RECOVERY WITHOUT DELAY AND RETIRE AT FLANK SPEED.</TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,16">4. THREAT: EXPECT SEA HARRIER PATROLS AND MISSILE-ARMED DESTROYERS AND FRIGATES. A RADAR PICKET IS BELIEVED TO BE STATIONED WEST OF THE MAIN BODY. ENEMY AIRCRAFT MAY SEARCH FOR OUR CARRIER AND FOLLOW THE RETURNING STRIKE.</TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,16">5. REMARKS: THE BRITISH CARRIERS PROVIDE THE PRINCIPAL AIR SUPPORT FOR OPERATIONS AGAINST OUR FORCES ON THE MALVINAS. SINKING ONE WOULD REMOVE A MAJOR PART OF THAT CAPABILITY AND COULD FORCE THE BRITISH TO NEGOTIATE.</TextBlock>
      <Border Height="1" Background="#7F939E" Opacity="0.35" Margin="0,4,0,18"/>
      <TextBlock Text="SECRET" TextAlignment="Center" FontSize="16" Foreground="#617A8C"/>
    </StackPanel>
  </Grid>
</Border>
